---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import WaIcon from './WaIcon.astro';
---
<section class="corp-sec" id="corporate">
  <div class="corp-wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="corp-kicker">For businesses</div>
      <div class="corp-h2">Employee transport<br>that doesn't break<br>at 3:30am.</div>
      <p class="corp-sub">Offices, factories, and hospitals near Pune, Aurangabad, and the AURIC industrial belt. We've done night shifts. We know what "reliable" actually means when a production line depends on your cabs showing up.</p>
      <div class="corp-feats">
        <div class="cf"><div class="cf-dot" style="color:#93C5FD"><Icon name="clipboard-list" size={18} /></div><div><div class="cf-title">Fixed monthly billing</div><div class="cf-body">One clean invoice at month end. Finance teams approve us in a day.</div></div></div>
        <div class="cf"><div class="cf-dot" style="color:#93C5FD"><Icon name="map-pin" size={18} /></div><div><div class="cf-title">GPS-tracked fleet — always</div><div class="cf-body">Live visibility for your ops team. Panic button on every vehicle.</div></div></div>
        <div class="cf"><div class="cf-dot" style="color:#93C5FD"><Icon name="moon" size={18} /></div><div><div class="cf-title">Night shift &amp; female safety protocol</div><div class="cf-body">Verified female co-ordinators, safety escort, pickup confirmation calls.</div></div></div>
        <div class="cf"><div class="cf-dot" style="color:#93C5FD"><Icon name="receipt" size={18} /></div><div><div class="cf-title">GST invoicing + account manager</div><div class="cf-body">Scales from 10 to 500+ employees. We handle routing, allocation, reporting.</div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="corp-btns">
        <button class="btn-cp" onclick="gate('corp')">Get a contract quote</button>
        <button class="btn-cw" onclick="window.wa('corporate')"><WaIcon size={16} /> WhatsApp our team</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="corp-card">
      <div class="corp-card-h">Request a quote</div>
      <div class="corp-card-sub">Our team responds within 2 working hours.</div>
      <div class="cfield"><label>Company name</label><input class="cinput" placeholder="Your organisation"/></div>
      <div class="cfield"><label>Contact person</label><input class="cinput" placeholder="HR / Admin manager name"/></div>
      <div class="cfield"><label>WhatsApp number</label><input class="cinput" type="tel" placeholder="+91 98765 43210"/></div>
      <div class="cfield"><label>Employees needing cabs</label><select class="cinput"><option>Under 10</option><option>10–30</option><option>30–100</option><option>100+</option></select></div>
      <div class="cfield"><label>Primary requirement</label><select class="cinput"><option>Daily shift transport</option><option>Night shift coverage</option><option>Executive travel</option><option>Airport drops</option><option>Mixed / not sure yet</option></select></div>
      <button class="btn-cs" onclick="gate('corp')">Send enquiry</button>
      <div class="corp-note">No commitment needed. We'll call to understand your needs first.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
